{"task_id": "HumanEval/1", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\n\ndef separate_paren_groups(paren_string: str) -> List[str]:\n    \"\"\"Separates multiple groups of nested parentheses into individual balanced groups, ignoring spaces.\n    Returns a list of balanced groups in sequential order.\"\"\"\n    result_groups: List[str] = []\n    balance_count: int = 0\n    current_group: str = \"\"\n\n    for char in paren_string:\n        if char == ' ':\n            continue\n\n        if char == '(':\n            balance_count += 1\n            current_group += char\n        elif char == ')':\n            balance_count -= 1\n            current_group += char\n\n        if balance_count == 0 and current_group:\n            result_groups.append(current_group)\n            current_group = \"\"\n\n    return result_groups\n```"}
